<Project Sdk="Dalamud.NET.Sdk/15.0.0">
  <PropertyGroup>
    <Version>0.1.0.10</Version>
    <Author>Momikk</Author>
    <Name>压价之王 UndercutKing</Name>
    <Punchline>高亮被压价的雇员物品，改价后及时更新。</Punchline>
    <Description>轻量雇员市场辅助：比对市场价格，在雇员销售列表与雇员列表中高亮被压价的物品。仅提供提示，不自动改价。由 Momikk 维护，部分库存与界面交互代码改编自 Critical_Impact 的 Allagan Market，采用 AGPL-3.0-or-later。</Description>
    <RepoUrl>https://github.com/Momikk/UndercutKing</RepoUrl>
    <IconUrl>https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Momikk/UndercutKing/main/images/icon.png</IconUrl>
    <PackageLicenseExpression>AGPL-3.0-or-later</PackageLicenseExpression>
    <Tags>market;retainer;undercut</Tags>
    <Changelog>0.1.0.10 更新说明 / Changelog
中文：
- 当前雇员出售列表中存在背包同物品蓝色提示时，同时为背包对应格子添加蓝框与浅蓝底色，忽略 NQ/HQ。
- 跟随背包排序与可见页面定位，关闭出售列表、切换雇员或关闭功能后自动撤掉；提供独立开关，不增加 Universalis 请求。
English:
- Mirror blue matches from the active retainer sale list onto matching normal-bag slots with blue borders and a translucent fill, treating NQ/HQ as identical.
- Follow inventory sorting and visible pages; remove frames on sale-list close, retainer change or disable. Include an independent toggle without additional Universalis requests.
完整记录 / Full history: https://github.com/Momikk/UndercutKing/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md</Changelog>
    <Nullable>enable</Nullable>
    <ImplicitUsings>enable</ImplicitUsings>
  </PropertyGroup>
  <ItemGroup>
    <PackageReference Include="MongoDB.Bson" Version="3.5.2" />
    <Content Include="../LICENSE.md" Link="LICENSE.md" CopyToOutputDirectory="PreserveNewest" />
    <Content Include="../NOTICE.md" Link="NOTICE.md" CopyToOutputDirectory="PreserveNewest" />
    <Content Include="../THIRD-PARTY-LICENSES.md" Link="THIRD-PARTY-LICENSES.md" CopyToOutputDirectory="PreserveNewest" />
  </ItemGroup>
</Project>
